1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,000
Night by the old torii gate.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,400
They say the fox fire
only lights up for those who <i>wait</i>.

3
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:09,800
{\an8}— Then I'll wait.

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,600
The lights flared one after another,
as if someone were counting steps.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,200
<b>Kitsunebi.</b>

6
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:19,600
<font color="#7FE8D8">See you tomorrow, fox.</font>
